      "date": "2026-04-18T23:06:01.000Z",
      "title": "NATCOPHARM: Future Diabetes Launch Will Face Softer Revenue Expectations",
      "body": "Analysts have revised their price target on NATCO Pharma from ₹982.64 to ₹938.10, citing updated assumptions that reflect softer revenue expectations, a higher projected profit margin and a lower future P/E multiple. What's in the News Launch of generic Semaglutide injection in India planned for March 2026, with multi dose vials priced at MRP of ₹1,290 per month for 2mg/1.5ml and 4mg/3ml, and ₹1,750 for 8mg/3ml, plus pen devices in April 2026 at MRPs of ₹4,000, ₹4,200 and ₹4,500 per month.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-natcopharm/natco-pharma-shares/16rzsz7x-high-value-randd-and-south-africa-entry-will-shape-uncertain-outcomes-yxbi/updates/11-analysts-have-revised-their-price-target-on-natco-pharma-fro",
