      "title": "NATCOPHARM: Diabetes Partnership And New Launches Will Support Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on NATCO Pharma to ₹1,391.29, reflecting slightly softer assumptions on revenue growth and profit margins, along with a modestly higher future P/E multiple. What's in the News NATCO received Central Drugs Standard Control Organisation approval to manufacture and market generic Semaglutide injection in India, with a launch planned in March 2026 for adults with insufficiently controlled type 2 diabetes (CDSCO approval).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-natcopharm/natco-pharma-shares/6qqi6upw-global-healthcare-trends-will-expand-affordable-generics-amid-risks-ypkd/updates/9-analysts-have-trimmed-their-price-target-on-natco-pharma-to",
