      "title": "NATCOPHARM: Diabetes Franchise Partnership And Demerger Plan Will Support Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have nudged their fair value estimate for NATCO Pharma slightly higher from ₹1,378.76 to ₹1,391.29, citing small adjustments to expected revenue contraction, profit margins and future P/E assumptions. What's in the News The board is scheduled to meet on March 24, 2026 to consider a Scheme of Arrangement to demerge the Agrochemicals Division into wholly owned subsidiary Natco Crop Health Sciences Limited, on a going concern basis (Board Meeting).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-natcopharm/natco-pharma-shares/6qqi6upw-global-healthcare-trends-will-expand-affordable-generics-amid-risks-ypkd/updates/8-analysts-have-nudged-their-fair-value-estimate-for-natco-pha",
