      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-03-06T10:03:58.000Z",
      "title": "NATCOPHARM: Domestic Diabetes Franchise Partnership Will Support Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have made only a marginal tweak to their fair value estimate for NATCO Pharma, keeping the price target effectively steady at about ₹1,379 as they fine tune assumptions around revenue contraction, profit margins and future P/E expectations. What's in the News Eris Lifesciences announced a partnership with NATCO Pharma to commercialise semaglutide in India, combining Eris's diabetes franchise with NATCO's manufacturing and regulatory capabilities for complex formulations (Client Announcement).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-natcopharm/natco-pharma-shares/6qqi6upw-global-healthcare-trends-will-expand-affordable-generics-amid-risks-ypkd/updates/7-analysts-have-made-only-a-marginal-tweak-to-their-fair-value",
